author : ???
e-mail : purumae@eyedentitygames.com
created date : 2010-01-06
description : ???? ?????.
return value :
0 = ??? ????.
1 = ????? Commit? ? ?? ?????. ????? Rollback???.
100 = ??? ??? ???????. dbo.ErrorLogs ???? ?????.
101114 = ??? ?? ??? ???????. ??? ???? ? ?? ??? ? ????.
101115 = ??? ???? ????.
101116 = ?? ???? ??? ?????.
101119 = ?? ??? ? ?? ???? ?? ???????.
