history :
4 = ?? ??? ??? ???? ???? ?? ?? at 2010-07-02
6 = ?? ?? ?? ??? ?? ?? at 2010-10-14
7 = RefundFlag, RefundDate ??? ??? ?? ?? at 2010-11-02
8 = ????? ?? ??? ?? (?? ??? ?? ??)     by 20110502.wgkim
