description :
	????? ??? ???? ?????.
return value :
	0 = ??? ????.
	1 = ????? Commit? ? ?? ?????. ????? Rollback???.
	100 = ??? ??? ???????. dbo.ErrorLogs ???? ?????.
	103123 = ??? ?????.
	103151 = ???? ???? ????.
	103174 = ?? ?? ??????.
	103175 = ???? ?? ?? ??????.
	103325 = ??? ??? ???? ??? ? ????.
history :
	5 = ?? ? ItemLocationIndex ?? NULL? ??? by ??? at 2011-10-21
	6 = (50500) ???? ???? ???? 103325? ????? ?? at 2012-01-31
